  "title": "Putting people at the heart of a digital healthcare system",
  "summary": "There’s no place like home Home truly is where the heart is. It’s a place of familiarity with the people and things around us and, for many of us, it’s the place where we feel most relaxed and happy. The sense of security often means that, when we need support with our health, home can offer one of the most comfortable paths to recovery.",
